From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephen Chenney <schenney@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:21:23 -0700
Subject: [HiC] Disallow SVG masks on SVG content in readback-allowed mode

We were missing a check for readback-allowed in SVGMaskPainter,
used to paint masks on SVG content.

Fixed: 572695599

CHECK on privacy

Change-Id: I1a2d07b756f5c6a5d9fe1fb5f2997fa7bf512e6d
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8580323
Commit-Queue: Stephen Chenney <schenney@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Stefan Zager <szager@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Stefan Zager <szager@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Stephen Chenney <schenney@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1718722}

Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y): M148 spells the html-in-canvas
privacy paint mode PaintFlag::kPrivacyPreserving (upstream:
kReadBackAllowedRendering) and checks images with
StyleImage::IsAccessAllowed(String&) (upstream: IsCorsSameOrigin()), exactly
as BoxPainterBase does on this branch, so the new check in PaintMaskLayer
uses those names. The upstream IterateFillLayersReveresed -> Reversed
rename hunk did not apply and is omitted (no behavior change).

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/paint/svg_mask_painter.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/paint/svg_mask_painter.cc
index 0f136f82906d71a4c4066200048358f9af54667f..5996671317fad34912eaa3c5373f174f99fc2cb3 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/paint/svg_mask_painter.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/paint/svg_mask_painter.cc
@@ -102,6 +102,12 @@ void PaintMaskLayer(const FillLayer& layer,
     return;
   }
 
+  String failing_url;
+  if ((paint_flags & PaintFlag::kPrivacyPreserving) &&
+      !style_image->IsAccessAllowed(failing_url)) {
+    return;
+  }
+
   std::optional<ScopedMaskLuminanceLayer> mask_luminance_scope;
   SkBlendMode composite_op = SkBlendMode::kSrcOver;
   // Don't use the operator if this is the bottom layer.
diff --git a/third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/html/canvas/element/manual/draw-element-image/privacy/svg/svg-mask-on-svg-content-ignored.tentative.https.sub.html b/third_party/blink/web_tests/external/wpt/html/canvas/element/manual/draw-element-image/privacy/svg/svg-mask-on-svg-content-ignored.tentative.https.sub.html
new file mode 100644
